  "description": "Where do animals live? Travel with Milo the bluebird to the hot desert, the snowy Arctic, the bamboo forest, the rainy jungle and the mountains. Is this the animal's home, yes or no? Find the real home of the arctic fox, the panda, the monkey and the bear, and see why they live there.\nAn interactive animal homes lesson for kids ages 2-6, with questions to answer, actions to copy and a quiz at the end.\n\nThe Animated Zoo makes gentle, colorful videos for little learners. New videos every day! Made with care for ages 2-6. Characters and visuals are animated with the help of AI tools and reviewed for kid safety before publishing.",
